Everything I do is directed towards
getting more meaning out of the content.

00:00:04.019 --> 00:00:05.760
Are there Steve Kaufmann here.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:10.530
Today I want to talk about
flashcards and learning vocabulary.

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:15.210
Uh, remember if you enjoy these
